      // 3 × 240s + 2 × 5s = 730s to 4 × 240s + 3 × 5s = 975s — at the
      // 10-21-measured ~95KB/s the old budget banked only ~71% of the
      // 97,238,501-byte asset, the new one ~93% with cross-run resume
      // covering the tail.
